# P1 swept from 0 (sparse 600 ms swells with gaps) to 255 (dense 15 ms haze) and back over a sine, with P2 at 96
# (reach 230 ms, wide): no clicks, steady level once the cloud is dense.
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 1
track fx1
input sine 330 0.25
preset 0 96 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 4 36
sweep p1 255 0 36 64
gain 1
expect sound 8 64
expect peak_below -3
